statue alak~
a statue of Alak~
&00A tall &10Golden&00 statue of Sir Alak stands here proudly.
~
A magnificent statue of the Legendary warrior Alak stands here before you.
The kindly smile on his face betrays the underlying grim determination with
which he faces all adversity.  You enjoy a great sense of both calm and relief
though you can almost see a grin on the face of the statue.  Not ever known
to be a strong follower of the Path of Paladin, Alak chose instead to forge 
his own path, helping those whom he could, while holding a strong disdain for
evil and wickedness.  He is known throughout the realms as a conduit of good,
and is well respected for his fight against the evil in the world.  His likeness
stands ready to return its masters equipment, while holding the fame Sword
of Justice, ever-ready to leap back into the hands of its one true owner.  Alak.
~
